abstract: "A workflow framework for human–AI collaborative research: four stages (Planning, Modeling, Reporting, Reviewing) with explicit decision rights, a shared research state, reviewer escalation, human gates, workflow evaluation, and an orchestrator that works with any agent (CLI agents, model APIs, or people)."
